# Code Style

- Use TypeScript strictly; no `any`
- Prefer Server Components unless interactivity is needed
- Use shadcn/ui for UI primitives
- Use Prisma for database access via `lib/db/`
- Use Zod for API/form validation
- Keep files small; extract reusable components
- Add clear types for all dashboard data
- Business logic in `lib/metrics/`, `lib/status/`, `lib/ai-summary/`
- UI rendering in `components/`

```typescript
// ✅ Query in server component
const tracks = await getTracksWithInitiatives();

// ❌ Don't put scoring logic in components
```
